# Slashless variants used to be normalized onto /gtw/ by Pages itself — that normalization
# only exists while the asset does, so the rename must cover them explicitly. The placeholder
# rule takes the per-language slashless form (a dynamic redirect). No .html rules: the page
# was always gtw/index.html, so /gtw.html never resolved (and Pages drops .html sources).
/gtw /spintax-editor/ 301
/:lang/gtw /:lang/spintax-editor/ 301
